# DressMe — frontend

- Small SPA/bundler OK (catalog + camera UX). Block Drop’s zero-build game rule does **not** apply.
- Prefer one app namespace / entry; keep phone-browser UX workable (capture, browse, collage).
- Same-origin API under `/api/*`; do not assume a separate API hostname.
- Photos stay client-side for collage; do not send wardrobe photos to the LLM in v1 (attrs + item IDs only).
- Version hashed/bundled assets or bump cache-bust query params on HTML references when shipping static builds.
- Imprint / legal pages stay lightweight static HTML if present.
